Z||000000||Veronica's V6 GT||03-07-2001||10:38 PM||||I have been reading the forum for a while and decided it's time to sign up.  I got my 88 fiero GT in the fall of last year. It's the first car I've ever owned that I can honestly say I LOVE MY CAR! I entered it in a show last fall and got 3rd place and I can't wait to go to alot more of the shows this year. I enjoy working on it, making all clean and shiny and most all driving it.  It is really awsome in the turns.  One of the last things it needs are gray 88 GT seat.  The previous owner replaced the old ones with mint 86 or 87 gray GT seats.n However I want the originals for shows. Check out my pride and joy. <P>This thread has grown to two pages, check page 2 for more pictures. Thanks   <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Vonnies_Fiero.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by Veronica's V6 GT (edited 03-11-2001).]||||reg||1
