Z||000026||Veronica's V6 GT||03-08-2001||05:52 PM||||WOW!!! I just got home from work and checked out the forum, thanks for all the replies guys.  I can't wait to go to some of the shows and put some faces with names.  I just about had myself talked into Daytona, but I won't make it this year. It's going to be on by calendar for next year though.  I'm planning on going to Englishtown NJ, Carlisle PA, Williamsburg VA, Denver PA and probably a few others. I'm a skier and love the snow, but I'm starting to think spring. I can't wait to be outside cleaning, waxing and tinkering with my car and going to the shows. Plus I really like to go to junkyards looking for Fieros with that something special I just might need. It's like a treasure hunt. Sounds like a fun filled summer to me!||||reg||1
